const lines=[['全部路線','#214d3d'],['淡水信義線','#cf5048'],['板南線','#477db2'],['松山新店線','#52856a'],['中和新蘆線','#d7a347'],['文湖線','#ac8860'],['環狀線','#a18c00'],['三鶯線','#61a6cb'],['淡海輕軌','#b16b86'],['安坑輕軌','#899348'],['機場捷運','#855b98']];
const data=[{id:1,name:'巷口牛肉麵',station:'東門',line:1,category:'台式小吃',price:220,walk:4,emoji:'🍜',bg:'#e9c5a0',desc:'一碗暖心紅燒湯頭，配上剛剛好的手工麵。'},{id:2,name:'日常珈琲室',station:'中山',line:1,category:'咖啡甜點',price:180,walk:5,emoji:'☕',bg:'#cbd1bd',desc:'留一個午後給自己，咖啡香裡慢慢看台北。'},{id:3,name:'小蒸籠食堂',station:'忠孝復興',line:2,category:'中式料理',price:280,walk:3,emoji:'🥟',bg:'#decbbb',desc:'熱氣蒸騰的小籠包，是週末最溫柔的開場。'},{id:4,name:'飯飯好日子',station:'公館',line:3,category:'台式小吃',price:90,walk:6,emoji:'🍚',bg:'#d4d7b7',desc:'滷汁、白飯與家常小菜，一份簡單的滿足。'},{id:5,name:'橙花甜點所',station:'古亭',line:4,category:'咖啡甜點',price:240,walk:4,emoji:'🍰',bg:'#e8c6bd',desc:'用一口季節水果蛋糕，把日常過得甜一點。'},{id:6,name:'青木小食堂',station:'南京復興',line:5,category:'日式料理',price:320,walk:7,emoji:'🍣',bg:'#c6d6cc',desc:'清爽的日式定食，填飽下班後的小小期待。'},{id:7,name:'街角熱壓吐司',station:'西門',line:2,category:'早午餐',price:130,walk:3,emoji:'🥪',bg:'#e5d6a8',desc:'酥脆吐司夾進豐盛餡料，今天就從這裡出發。'},{id:8,name:'山邊茶屋',station:'大安',line:1,category:'茶飲甜點',price:160,walk:8,emoji:'🍵',bg:'#c5d1b4',desc:'一壺茶、一點甜，找回城市裡安靜的角落。'},{id:9,name:'暖暖咖哩',station:'松江南京',line:4,category:'日式料理',price:260,walk:5,emoji:'🍛',bg:'#debc93',desc:'香料慢慢熬出的濃郁，每一口都是療癒。'}];
function read(key){try{const v=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key)||'[]');return Array.isArray(v)?v.filter(id=>data.some(d=>d.id===id)):[]}catch{return []}}
let saved=read('metro-saved'),trip=read('metro-trip'),line=0,view='all';const $=s=>document.querySelector(s);function toast(t){$('#toast').textContent=t;$('#toast').classList.add('show');clearTimeout(window.toastTimer);window.toastTimer=setTimeout(()=>$('#toast').classList.remove('show'),2200)}
$('#lines').innerHTML=lines.map((l,i)=>`<button data-line="${i}" class="${i===0?'active':''}"><i class="dot" style="--line:${l[1]}"></i>${l[0]}</button>`).join('');
function stations(){let selected=$('#station').value;$('#station').innerHTML='<option value="">所有車站</option>'+window.Metro.find({line:['','R','BL','G','O','BR','Y','LB','V','K','A'][line]}).map(s=>s.name).map(s=>`<option>${s}</option>`).join('');if([...$('#station').options].some(o=>o.value===selected))$('#station').value=selected}
function render(){const q=$('#search').value.trim().toLowerCase();let items=data.filter(d=>(!line||d.line===line)&&(!$('#station').value||d.station===$('#station').value)&&d.price<=Number($('#budget').value)&&`${d.name}${d.station}${d.category}${d.desc}`.toLowerCase().includes(q)&&(view==='all'||(view==='saved'?saved:trip).includes(d.id)));if($('#sort').value==='price')items.sort((a,b)=>a.price-b.price);if($('#sort').value==='walk')items.sort((a,b)=>a.walk-b.walk);if(view==='trip'&&$('#sort').value==='default')items.sort((a,b)=>trip.indexOf(a.id)-trip.indexOf(b.id));$('#viewTitle').textContent={all:'今天，想在哪一站吃？',saved:'收藏下一次的好味道。',trip:'我的美食散步清單。'}[view];$('#resultCount').innerHTML=`找到 <strong>${items.length}</strong> 個美食靈感${view==='trip'?' · 依加入順序排列':''}`;$('#savedCount').textContent=saved.length;$('#tripCount').textContent=trip.length;$('#empty').hidden=items.length>0;$('#cards').innerHTML=items.map(d=>`<article class="card"><div class="card-art" style="--bg:${d.bg}"><span class="dish" aria-hidden="true">${d.emoji}</span><span class="category">${d.category}</span><button class="save ${saved.includes(d.id)?'on':''}" data-save="${d.id}" aria-label="${saved.includes(d.id)?'取消收藏':'收藏'}${d.name}" aria-pressed="${saved.includes(d.id)}">${saved.includes(d.id)?'♥':'♡'}</button></div><div class="card-body"><div class="station-label"><i class="dot" style="--line:${lines[d.line][1]}"></i>${d.station}站 · 步行約 ${d.walk} 分鐘</div><h3><button data-detail="${d.id}">${d.name} ↗</button></h3><p class="desc">${d.desc}</p><div class="card-bottom"><span>NT$ <strong>${d.price}</strong> <small>／人</small></span><button data-trip="${d.id}">${trip.includes(d.id)?'✓ 已加入 · 移除':'+ 加入散步清單'}</button></div></div></article>`).join('')}
function changeView(v){document.querySelector('#demo-explore').open=true;view=v;document.querySelectorAll('.nav').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.view===v));render();$('#explore').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})}
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const b=e.target.closest('button');if(!b)return;if(b.dataset.line!==undefined){line=Number(b.dataset.line);document.querySelectorAll('[data-line]').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',Number(x.dataset.line)===line));stations();render()}if(b.dataset.view)changeView(b.dataset.view);for(const kind of ['save','trip'])if(b.dataset[kind]){const id=Number(b.dataset[kind]);let arr=kind==='save'?saved:trip;const had=arr.includes(id);arr=had?arr.filter(x=>x!==id):[...arr,id];if(kind==='save')saved=arr;else trip=arr;try{localStorage.setItem(kind==='save'?'metro-saved':'metro-trip',JSON.stringify(arr))}catch{toast('裝置無法儲存，資料僅保留在本次操作')}render();toast(had?'已從清單移除':kind==='save'?'已收藏這個好味道':'已加入散步清單')}if(b.dataset.detail){const d=data.find(x=>x.id===Number(b.dataset.detail));$('#detailBody').innerHTML=`<div class="detail-dish">${d.emoji}</div><div class="eyebrow">${lines[d.line][0]} · ${d.station}站</div><h2>${d.name}</h2><p>${d.desc}</p><p>每人參考預算：NT$${d.price}<br>步行時間：約 ${d.walk} 分鐘<br>料理類型：${d.category}</p><p class="data-note">此為虛構示範店家，用於體驗搜尋與行程收藏。正式資料可加入地址、營業時間與導航。</p>`;$('#detail').showModal()}});
$('#close').onclick=()=>$('#detail').close();$('#detail').addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target===$('#detail'))$('#detail').close()});$('#search').oninput=render;['station','budget','sort'].forEach(id=>$('#'+id).onchange=render);$('#showTrip').onclick=()=>changeView('trip');$('#reset').onclick=()=>{$('#search').value='';$('#station').value='';$('#budget').value='9999';line=0;view='all';document.querySelector('[data-line="0"]').click();changeView('all')};stations();render();
